| `make site-static` `[local]` | Snapshots the showcase to static files for a static site build. | `make site-static` | [`BASE_URL`](settings.md#make-variables), [`corpus.served_visibilities`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Without the showcase it skips and says so. Writes only nodes at a served level, and a refused level exits 14 with nothing written. Every output is checked before mutation: configured destinations must resolve inside the project (exit 14), and relative --out-dir destinations must stay there too (exit 2). An explicit absolute --out-dir authorizes that output directory. Checks judge paths at call time; a link swapped before the write is not caught. | [generate-and-upgrade.md](../guides/generate-and-upgrade.md) | always |
